  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The most common mass-produced anti-magic weapon, this grenade is commonly used to subdue spellcasters.</p><p><br />As an action, you can throw the spellbreaker grenade to a point within 60 feet of you, where it releases a wave of anti-magic, affecting all creatures, objects, or magical effects in a 10 ft radius sphere. Any spell of 2nd level or lower on the target ends. For each spell of higher level up to level 4, roll a d20 and add +1. If the result is equal to or greater than 10 + the spell's level, the spell ends.</p>",
